      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d35e00ef32ead2343a374f7|full_name} if your gesture is taking that long it means it is longer than 2 frames. Currently you can only have a gesture animation override on an avatar that is 2 frames.\n\nIf you want a separate animation not controlled by the gesture system you will most likely need to implement one of the workarounds such as the animation toggle keyframe, state machine, etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
