      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: Being longer than 2 frames is the entire point, i dont see any reason why we cannot have anything over 2 frames. i know the avatarAnimationtemplate has the Transitions set to 4% of the animation length. even after testing around with it by changing this value i still cannot accomplish my goal, yes i could use a state machine but in the end this is a feature request and not a help request. if i could have a revolver cocking animation and then another to have it fire and move the ammo canister and be perfectly timed to the hammer that would be great, i live for details like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
