      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a good example of one of the features that we would make if we had custom animators. But if custom animators are simply not possible, then we would still appreciate the built in animator to be a little bit more robust and include this very simple feature. It's literally just turning on a checkbox (and a checkbox that was already on by default at that).",
      "viewerReactions": null
