  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-22T16:10:54.450Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Basically i want to be able to press finger point and be able to cock my revolver without having the animation take 3 years to begin and end and not able to be interrupted with other hand emotes, basically animating using the animator to move my thumb and press the hammer down on my revolver. i have seen many people use entire extra avatars just to accomplish this.   Additionally do you guys have the animation speed on the custom override set way low to make smooth transitions between animations? if so can i change that or something, im guessing this would solve my problem as well",
